      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In this case, he kicked himself. What you can still do is go to your launchpad, go to the \"Recently Played With\" list and the user should be there so that you can send a report to VRChat as well as block them.\n\nIf that's the UI path that the user will take, then maybe it'll be a good idea to add instance specific moderation actions on the \"Moderate User\". Things like \"Ban from Group\", \"Ban from Group Instances\", \"Ban from current instance\" (if the player is the uploader or owner of the world).",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
