  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-05-31T01:34:00.753Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "If a person leaves a group instance before I have a chance to click them to ban them, there should still be a way to find them in the menu or on the website and ban them from there. \n\nAn example that happened earlier today, someone shouted a racial obscenity in front of a streamer and then immediately left the world so that nobody was able to click on them to kick them.",
